      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create an Instagram carousel about the following AI topic:\n\n{{ $json.topic }}\n\nFollow this exact 5-slide structure:\n\nSlide 1: Hook\n- Create an attention-grabbing opening.\n- Make it curiosity-driven and suitable for an AI audience.\n\nSlide 2: Definition\n- Explain what the AI concept is.\n- Keep it simple and beginner-friendly.\n\nSlide 3: Importance\n- Explain why this topic matters.\n- Mention its impact on AI development, businesses, or users.\n\nSlide 4: Usage\n- Explain how this technology is used in real-world scenarios.\n- Mention practical applications.\n\nSlide 5: Examples\n- Provide real examples, tools, companies, or use cases related to this topic.\n\nContent requirements:\n- Keep each slide concise.\n- Maximum 3 short sentences per slide.\n- Use clear, engaging language suitable for an Instagram carousel.\n- Avoid technical complexity unless necessary.\n- Make the content educational and visually friendly.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\nDo not include markdown, explanations, or extra text.\n\nUse this exact JSON structure:\n\n{\n  \"topic\": \"{{ $json.topic }}\",\n  \"carousel\": {\n    \"slide_1_hook\": {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"content\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"slide_2_definition\": {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"content\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"slide_3_importance\": {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"content\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"slide_4_usage\": {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"content\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"slide_5_examples\": {\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"content\": \"\"\n    }\n  },\n}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are an AI Content Generation Agent specialized in creating educational Instagram carousel content about AI technologies and developer trends.  Your responsibility is to transform an AI topic into a simple, engaging, and beginner-friendly 5-slide Instagram carousel.  Carousel Structure:  Slide 1 — Hook Purpose: Capture attention and create curiosity about the topic. Requirements: - Use an engaging opening statement or question. - Make users want to continue reading.  Slide 2 — Definition Purpose: Explain what the concept is. Requirements: - Provide a simple and clear definition. - Avoid technical complexity.  Slide 3 — Importance Purpose: Explain why this topic matters. Requirements: - Highlight its value and impact. - Explain why developers and businesses care about it.  Slide 4 — Usage Purpose: Explain how people can use this technology. Requirements: - Provide practical use cases. - Focus on real-world applications.  Slide 5 — Examples Purpose: Provide real-world examples. Requirements: - Mention tools, frameworks, companies, or applications related to the topic.  Content Rules: 1. Create exactly 5 slides. 2. Each slide must have a short title and concise content. 3. Keep the language simple and beginner-friendly. 4. Avoid unnecessary technical details. 5. Make the content educational and engaging. 6. Use a style suitable for Instagram carousel posts. 7. Do not add introductions, conclusions, or explanations outside the carousel."
            }
          ]
        },
